      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SOUTH SEAS ROCK NZ (2) has been tackling stronger company and there was plenty to like about latest effort when he came from this barrier for third behind topliner Captains Knock. He'll enjoy the class drop and should get the favours from this draw. NO NOTTHEBUTTONS (6) broke early so did well to recover and place last week, finishing less than 2m off the winner. He draws a couple of spots lower and has won both previous attempts at this longer distance. DANCE WITH CARMER (3) hasn't raced since he placed at Listed level here in June but he has won fresh before and should be ready to go off a trial win. CATCHAFIRE NZ (5) is unbeaten second-up so can progress off his resuming effort when only 3.4m off the winner.",
